   'time',
   'Crain honors Officer Michael "Freight" Crain, 34, of Beaumont, California, a former U.S. Marine Corps sergeant who served 11 years with the Riverside Police Department in field operations and on the SWAT Team. He was fatally shot in an apparent ambush while on patrol on Feb. 7, 2013.

You complete two rounds of seven movements with 34 reps each: push-ups, deadlifts (135 lb / 95 lb), box jumps (24 in for everyone), clean and jerks (95 lb / 65 lb), burpees, wall balls (20 lb / 14 lb) and pull-ups. A 50-yard sprint follows every movement. That adds up to 476 reps and 14 sprints. No load is very heavy, but the volume and the constant sprints make this a long grind.',
   '[{"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "34", "tip": "Chest to the floor and a straight body line. Break into small sets from the start."}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Run hard but stay in control. You sprint after every movement."}, {"name": "Deadlifts", "reps": "34", "tip": "Flat back and the bar close to your legs.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Use the sprint to reset your breathing before the box."}, {"name": "Box Jumps", "reps": "34", "tip": "Step down to save your legs. CrossFit lists a 24 in box for both men and women.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "24 in"}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Shake out your legs as you go."}, {"name": "Clean and Jerks", "reps": "34", "tip": "The bar is light, so use quick sets or fast singles.", "rx_men": "95 lb", "rx_women": "65 lb"}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Keep your stride short and quick."}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "34", "tip": "Find a steady rhythm and breathe at the top."}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Settle your breathing before the wall balls."}, {"name": "Wall Balls", "reps": "34", "tip": "Hit the target on every rep: 10 ft for men, 9 ft for women.", "rx_men": "20 lb", "rx_women": "14 lb"}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Last sprint before the pull-ups."}, {"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "34", "tip": "Chin over the bar. Break into sets before your grip fails."}, {"name": "Sprint", "reps": "50 yd", "tip": "Then start round two, or finish the workout."}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Small sets from the first rep", "Sprint fast but stay in control", "Set up every station before you start"]'::jsonb,
