   'Lower the deadlifts to 155 lb / 105 lb and the clean and jerks to 95 lb / 65 lb. Replace pull-ups with jumping pull-ups or ring rows, and knees-to-elbows with hanging knee raises. Cut to 3 rounds if five would take more than about 30 minutes.',
